    {
      "slug": "resume-contact",
      "title": "Profile & Tools",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.luccote.com/resume-contact",
      "text": [
        {
          "kind": "h1",
          "text": "About"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Lucien Marcel Coté"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "3D Generalist • Systems Analyst • Creative Technologist"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "With nearly two decades of professional experience, I specialize in creative solutions that exist at the intersection of design, code, and visual storytelling. My journey has spanned AAA character pipelines, real-time VR simulations, municipal systems analysis, and full-stack software development."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "I’ve worked with major studios like Rockstar, Warner Brothers, and SuperGenius, as well as startups and government agencies. Regardless of the industry or scope, my focus has always been the same: solve problems through clarity, creativity, and technical finesse."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "I bring a full-stack mindset to the world of 3D—from sculpting and texturing to building out custom tools that streamline entire workflows. I’m just as comfortable debugging shaders as I am leading a team through the launch of a VR training module."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Let’s build something extraordinary."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Tools & Technologies"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Autodesk Maya • Zbrush • Substance Painter • Blender • Houdini • Unity • Unreal • MEL • Python • React • C# • Azure • Salesforce • SQL"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Contact me or explore my LinkedIn"
        }
